note `send` needs an Open Connection; after `close` the connection is consumed,
note and `closed` is a Closed Connection.
note Expected diagnostic: `connection` was consumed by `close` on the line before.
note Expected diagnostic: `send` needs an Open Connection; `closed` is Closed.
type Connection
    socket: Socket
    states Closed, Open

function send(data: Bytes, connection: editable Open Connection)
    transmit(data, connection.socket)

function close(connection: consumed Open Connection) -> Closed Connection
    return release(connection)

function misuse(connection: consumed Open Connection, data: Bytes)
    let closed = close(connection)
    send(data, connection)
    send(data, closed)
